{"availability":"available","full":"patharearya/internship-tracker","name":"internship-tracker","description":"Live US internships and funded research programmes, read straight from employers' own job boards, USAJOBS, NSF and NIH, grouped by major, with a planner synced to your own Google Drive.","category":"Other","language":"Java","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T02:13:27Z","updated":"2026-10-13T20:26:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://patharearya.github.io/internship-tracker/","topics":["github-actions","github-pages","greenhouse","internships","java","job-board","students","workday"],"demo":"https://patharearya.github.io/internship-tracker/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:47:43.534Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:47:43.534Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:47:43.534Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:22.488Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:47:43.534Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live internships and funded research programmes for US college students, read straight from employers' own job boards and federal sources, grouped by major, with a planner to track applying.","Students check dozens of career pages to catch internships the moment they open, because early applicants are seen first. Postings are scattered across employers' own sites, and no single place shows, for a student's own major, what is open now and when it opened.","This site gathers them in one place. It uses first-party sources only (employers' own job boards, USAJOBS, NSF and NIH), never aggregators. It also records, from its own monitoring, when each posting first appeared and when it closed."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patharearya/internship-tracker/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f55ccd1284436bec6c1f1b1bd9e5551693ce9c195ee14a7e7c452af20f2fc629","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:22.583Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:2